-- or 25% at a business the car loves (driverPayout in src/game/data.ts).
--   * The catalog gains driverBonus, the most a driver adds (0.25).
--   * A business with a driver refills the town-worth bank that much faster.
-- Built by src/game/econCatalog.ts; economy.test.ts keeps it in step.

